    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious 4 bed mid terrace house, with front and rear gardensLarge rear extension with downstairs bedroom and shower roomNew composite front door and front windowsMature settled development Large front garden with ample off-street parkingGas central heatingClose to all local amenities of BalbrigganMins walk to Beach and harbour\n\nNestled within the mature and well-established development of Derham Park, this spacious four-bedroom mid-terrace residence presents an exceptional opportunity for families, first-time buyers, and those seeking a home with generous living space in a highly convenient coastal setting. Enjoying both front and rear gardens, the property has been thoughtfully extended to the rear, creating a versatile layout that offers excellent flexibility for modern family living.\nThe impressive rear extension incorporates a spacious ground-floor bedroom and a contemporary shower room, making it an ideal space for guests, multi-generational living, or a home office. The accommodation is further enhanced by double-glazed windows to the front, gas-fired central heating, and recently installed front-facing windows together with a stylish composite front door, adding both comfort and kerb appeal.\nExternally, the property continues to impress. A generous front garden with ample off-street parking, while the private rear garden that is perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining. While the property has been well maintained, it offers purchasers an exciting opportunity to personalise the interiors. Some cosmetic modernisation, including upgrades to the kitchen, bathroom, and internal décor, would further enhance what is already a spacious and well-proportioned family home, allowing the new owners to create a home tailored to their own taste and style.\nLocation is another standout feature. Derham Park is a long-established and highly regarded residential neighbourhood, ideally positioned within easy reach of Balbriggan's excellent range of amenities, including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, and public transport links. The beautiful beach and picturesque harbour are just a short stroll away, offering the perfect setting for coastal walks, water activities, and enjoying everything this vibrant seaside town has to offer.\nCombining generous accommodation, valuable additional living space, excellent outdoor features, and an enviable location close to the coast, 39 Derham Park represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a home with immense potential in one of Balbriggan's most convenient and sought-after residential settings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nOpen porch - \nshared with neighbouring house, door to utility room\n\nEntrance Hall - \nwith tiled floor\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 3.6m\nwith laminate flooring, open fire with surround, T.V. point and large window to the front\n\nKitchen - 5.5m x 2.4m\n(5.5m x 3m) tiled flooring, range of fitted kitchen presses, storage presses, door to utility area\n\nUtility Room - \nwith press units and door to rear hallway with access to gardens\n\nShower room - \nFully tiled with wc, whb and shower unit.\n\nBedroom Four - \ndouble room with laminate flooring.\n\nLanding - \nwith attic access and storage cuboard\n\nBedroom One - 3.7m x 3.1m\nwith good double room to rear of house with built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.6m x 3.2m\nDouble room to front of house\n\nBedroom Three - 2.5m x 2.5m\nSingle room to front of house\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.9m\nwith tiled flooring, wc, whb and bath.\n\n"
      },
